          "download_url": "https://pdf.s3.us-southeast-1.idrivee2.com/novels/the_scoundrel_immortals_coup/481_The%20Scoundrel%20Immortal%E2%80%99s%20Coup%20-%20Vol%2001.pdf?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=L01XesFy3RgmqaeVQsOY%2F20261107%2Fus-southeast-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20261107T093543Z&X-Amz-Expires=604800&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=ddb635ea24603fd42196949c617d0ceabfddab7e1bee1573eb9497966ba5d448",
          "filename": "The Scoundrel Immortal’s Coup - Vol 01.pdf",
          "first": 1,
